/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_105308.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_105308.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_105308-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_105308-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_105308-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 4032px) 100vw, 4032px\" \/><\/a> <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111534.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5174 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111534.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111534.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111534-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111534-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111534-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 4032px) 100vw, 4032px\" \/><\/a> <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111748.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5175 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111748.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111748.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111748-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111748-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111748-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 4032px) 100vw, 4032px\" \/><\/a> <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111758.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5176 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111758.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111758.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111758-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111758-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111758-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 4032px) 100vw, 4032px\" \/><\/a> <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111856.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5177 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111856-e1543356975877.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3024\" height=\"4032\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111856-e1543356975877.jpg 405w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111856-e1543356975877-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_111856-e1543356975877-768x1024.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 3024px) 100vw, 3024px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Although you don&#8217;t see a lot of pretty multi-colored flowers like those of us from the mid-west are so accustomed to, when we look closely we can see the buds and blossoms on the cactus and see the beauty that the desert has to offer.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We took a drive over to Avocado Nursery near Coolidge, AZ &#8211; only about 20 minutes or so northeast of our spot at Rover&#8217;s Roost RV Park.\u00a0 Kathy had a small Barrel Cactus that she had bought at Kroger in 2016 and it&#8217;s been on the dashboard of the coach ever since.\u00a0 